---
const problems = [
  'Manual bookkeeping errors',
  'Stock mismanagement',
  'Expired goods losses',
  'Slow checkout process',
  'Poor visibility into business performance',
];
---

<section class="px-4 py-20 md:px-6 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div data-reveal>
        <h2 id="problem-heading" class="section-title">The cost of disconnected tools</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Spreadsheets and guesswork quietly drain margin—especially when inventory and checkout are not speaking the
          same language.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-10 list-none space-y-4">
          {
            problems.map((p) => (
              <li class="flex gap-3 text-[17px] leading-snug text-surface-900">
                <span
                  class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-600"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                />
                {p}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <div class="glass rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-10">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-600">The NutaPOS answer</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-surface-900 md:text-3xl">
            Automation and real-time tracking
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
            NutaPOS unifies sales, stock, and bookkeeping so your team works from one source of truth. Alerts surface
            before problems become losses—ideal for management software that needs to stay fast at the counter and
            accurate in the back office.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
